CLO5. use powerful techniques for handling computing problems in Mathematics and Computation;
CLO6. understand important structures having wide applications to sciences, computer programming and
various classification problems.;
CLO7. to create new relations with useful properties from a given relation;
CLO8. to learn basic concepts of Graph theory.

